    "body": "Returned failure: holding F3 still crashes the game. I moved this back to `actionable` immediately.\n\nThe retained exception trace identifies the exact unsafe stage: RDR2 raises an access violation at `RDR2.exe+0x25F799A` while GameplayTweaks is in `campMessage.showTooltip`, followed by stack overflow. F3 reaches that call only after the campsite removal transaction, when it tries to post `Campsite removed.` through `_SHOW_TOOLTIP`. This is not evidence against the key hold or saved-row lookup; it is direct evidence that the custom tooltip ABI remains unsafe.\n\nI am removing that native from every campsite result path, preserving the exact F3 row/blip/physical-camp cleanup, and rebuilding. I will not reopen closed Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#211; Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 is the live returned-failure tracker.",
